{"html_text": {"ja388:0.1": "<article id='ja388'><header><ul><li class='division'>{}</li>", "ja388:0.2": "<li>{}</li>", "ja388:0.3": "<li>{}</li></ul>", "ja388:0.4": "<h1 class='sutta-title'>{}</h1></header>", "ja388:1.1": "<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja388:1.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja388:1.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja388:1.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja388:2.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja388:2.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja388:2.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja388:2.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja388:3.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja388:3.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja388:3.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja388:3.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja388:4.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja388:4.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja388:4.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja388:4.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja388:5.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja388:5.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja388:5.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja388:5.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja388:6.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja388:6.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja388:6.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja388:6.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja388:7.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja388:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja388:0.2": "Chakkanipāta ", "ja388:0.3": "Kharaputtavagga ", "ja388:0.4": "3. Tuṇḍilajātaka ", "ja388:1.1": "“Navachannake dāni diyyati, ", "ja388:1.2": "Puṇṇāyaṁ doṇi suvāminī ṭhitā; ", "ja388:1.3": "Bahuke jane pāsapāṇike, ", "ja388:1.4": "No ca kho me paṭibhāti bhuñjituṁ”. ", "ja388:2.1": "“Tasasi bhamasi leṇamicchasi, ", "ja388:2.2": "Attāṇosi kuhiṁ gamissasi; ", "ja388:2.3": "Appossukko bhuñja tuṇḍila, ", "ja388:2.4": "Maṁsatthāya hi positāmhase. ", "ja388:3.1": "Ogaha rahadaṁ akaddamaṁ, ", "ja388:3.2": "Sabbaṁ sedamalaṁ pavāhaya; ", "ja388:3.3": "Gaṇhāhi navaṁ vilepanaṁ, ", "ja388:3.4": "Yassa gandho na kadāci chijjati”. ", "ja388:4.1": "“Katamo rahado akaddamo, ", "ja388:4.2": "Kiṁsu sedamalanti vuccati; ", "ja388:4.3": "Katamañca navaṁ vilepanaṁ, ", "ja388:4.4": "Yassa gandho na kadāci chijjati”. ", "ja388:5.1": "“Dhammo rahado akaddamo, ", "ja388:5.2": "Pāpaṁ sedamalanti vuccati; ", "ja388:5.3": "Sīlañca navaṁ vilepanaṁ, ", "ja388:5.4": "Tassa gandho na kadāci chijjati. ", "ja388:6.1": "Nandanti sarīraghātino, ", "ja388:6.2": "Na ca nandanti sarīradhārino; ", "ja388:6.3": "Puṇṇāya ca puṇṇamāsiyā, ", "ja388:6.4": "Ramamānāva jahanti jīvitan”ti. ", "ja388:7.1": "Tuṇḍilajātakaṁ tatiyaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja388:0.1": "", "ja388:0.2": "", "ja388:0.3": "", "ja388:0.4": "", "ja388:1.1": "Navachannake → navachandake (bj, pts-vp-pli1); navacchaddake (sya1ed, sya2ed) | dāni → doṇi (mr); dāne (katthaci) ", "ja388:1.2": "", "ja388:1.3": "", "ja388:1.4": "", "ja388:2.1": "", "ja388:2.2": "", "ja388:2.3": "", "ja388:2.4": "positāmhase → posiyāmase (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja388:3.1": "", "ja388:3.2": "", "ja388:3.3": "", "ja388:3.4": "", "ja388:4.1": "", "ja388:4.2": "", "ja388:4.3": "", "ja388:4.4": "", "ja388:5.1": "", "ja388:5.2": "", "ja388:5.3": "", "ja388:5.4": "", "ja388:6.1": "", "ja388:6.2": "", "ja388:6.3": "", "ja388:6.4": "", "ja388:7.1": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja388:0.1": "", "ja388:0.2": "", "ja388:0.3": "", "ja388:0.4": "", "ja388:1.1": "ms22J_1420, msdiv89, pts-vp-pli3.288", "ja388:1.2": "", "ja388:1.3": "", "ja388:1.4": "", "ja388:2.1": "csp1ed22.148, csp2ed22.148, dr27.201, ms22J_1421, msdiv90, ndp22.139, pts-vp-pli3.289", "ja388:2.2": "", "ja388:2.3": "", "ja388:2.4": "", "ja388:3.1": "ms22J_1422, msdiv91, sya27.202", "ja388:3.2": "", "ja388:3.3": "", "ja388:3.4": "", "ja388:4.1": "ms22J_1423, msdiv92, pts-vp-pli3.29